what: cosmetic, operator's pick (2026-09-15) over an indexed leaf enum:
  Cont's erased leaf type `(X => Nothing) => Any` written ONCE as an
  opaque `Shift[+X]` inside Cont, with `Shift.of[X, S, R](f)` the
  typed door in (an upcast) and `s.at[S, R]` the one door out (THE
  cast, where `typed` was). Same bytes, same cast count; the ugly type
  leaves every signature. Cont.scala only.
